 "text": "-->\nTreasurer's Office | huroncounty\ntop of page\nSkip to Main Content\nHuron County\nYour Welcoming Neighbor\nCommunity Info\nSmart 911 Signup\nAccessibility\nHome\nMeetings Calendar\nElections\nDepartments\nEmployment Opportunities\nForms & Applications\nRFP's\nProjects\nContact Us\nAbout Us\nMore\nUse tab to navigate through the menu items.\nLog In\nTreasurer's Office\n250 East Huron Avenue\nRoom 204\nBad Axe, MI 48413\nPhone: 989-269-9238\n​\nPay Taxes Online\nPay Dog License Online\nDelinquent Tax Information\nDog / Kennel License\nCounty Assessing & Tax Search\nLocal Treasurers\nLand Sale (External)\nLand Bank Sales\nClaim Remaining Foreclosure Proceeds\nACH Authorization Form\nExcess Proceeds CLaim Form\nForm to File with Circuit Court for Excess Proceeds\nPersonal Property Tax Exemption Form\nPoverty Exemption Form\nVeteran's Exemption Form\nSummer Tax Deferment Form\nLand Division Certification Form\nClick here for updated info on our hours\nThe Huron County Treasurer’s Office is now accepting ACH payments for your Delinquent Taxes, Summer - City of Harbor Beach taxes & Summer - Grant Township taxes. Please complete the authorization form and mail to:\n​\nHuron County Treasurer’s Office\nPO Box 69\nBad Axe MI 48413\nOr please call our office at 989.269.9238 to complete the form with a member of our staff.\nWe will continue to accept credit card payments. Please note that there is a 3% convenience fee on either credit or debit cards.\n​\n​\nOffice hours are Monday - Friday 8:30am - 4:30pm.\nWe do not close for lunch.\nStaff\n​\n​​\nSheryl L. Jahn, Treasurer\n​​\nLaura Tyll, Chief Deputy Treasurer\n​​​\nAdam Rifenbark, Deputy Treasurer II\n​​​\nTillie Peruski, Deputy Treasurer II\n​\nKali Ewald, Deputy Treasurer I\n​​​\n​\n​​\n​\n​\n​\n250 E. Huron Ave\nBad Axe, MI 48413\n​\n​\nCounty Court Hours:\n8:30 a.m. - 4:30 p.m.\nMonday through Friday\n​\nCounty Office Hours:\n8:00 a.m. – 4:30 p.m.\nMonday through Friday\nHuron County Building\nHuron County is committed to making our website accessible to all users, including those with disabilities. If you have specific questions or feedback about this site’s accessibility or need assistance using specific features, please email the Huron County CIS department at cis@co.huron.mi.us.\nHome\nMeetings Calendar\nElections\nDepartments\nEmployment Opportunities\nForms & Applications\nRFP's\nProjects\nContact Us\nAbout Us\nMore\nUse tab to navigate through the menu items.\nbottom of page",
